WEBVTT

00:02:00.109 --> 00:02:01.283
What you have to do

00:02:01.307 --> 00:02:03.905
is you have to make people
believe absurdities.

00:02:05.096 --> 00:02:07.587
And once people believe absurdities,

00:02:07.611 --> 00:02:09.906
then they start to commit atrocities.

00:02:10.239 --> 00:02:11.834
That's the dynamic of this thing.

00:02:11.858 --> 00:02:13.925
You can't create "us versus them" --

00:02:14.236 --> 00:02:16.434
you can't have the massacres
you had in Rwanda,

00:02:16.458 --> 00:02:19.051
you can't have the massacres
you had in Yugoslavia --

00:02:19.839 --> 00:02:22.315
unless if you create this dynamic.

00:02:22.339 --> 00:02:24.632
Let me summarize
current immigration policy.

00:02:24.656 --> 00:02:26.474
Let's deter "Them"

00:02:26.498 --> 00:02:29.839
by being as cruel as we can possibly be,

00:02:29.863 --> 00:02:31.996
and let's target their children.